# --- Il girato del video, e quello che ne esce ---
# Sono registrazioni dello schermo del portafoglio vero, e pesano centinaia di megabyte:
# uno solo di quei file supera il limite che GitHub accetta.
scripts/video/shot/
scripts/video/build/
scripts/video/voice/
*.mp4
*.wav

# --- Il file vero del worker, che dice quale infrastruttura c'e' dietro ---
tools/seeker-worker/wrangler.toml

# Roba compilata di Python, generata girando gli strumenti.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- The census, kept out of the public repo on purpose ---
# 10,527 addresses with a tier and a balance. These are public chain facts, and anyone
# with an RPC key rebuilds them in a day. But here they were a list you could browse in
# one click: "these wallets own a Seeker, and here are the 1,252 richest". Those people
# never asked to be in a target list, and elsewhere we avoid even archiving which mint a
# budget is checking.
# It stays inside the APK, because the fallback scan and the live feed's size label read
# it. Regenerate it with the tools in tools/seeker-worker: see SEEKER-SCOUT.md.
app/src/main/assets/seekers.txt
